{"seq":4,"slug":"documentation-standards","title":"文档规范","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-craftsmanship/code-quality-standards/documentation-standards","wordCount":1372,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"文档规范\">文档规范</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>文档规范要回答的是&quot;把哪种信息写在哪种载体上&quot;：代码解释 How，文档解释 Why 与 When，且每种文档只服务一类读者和一类问题。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>职责边界</strong>：代码说明做了什么与怎么做，文档说明为什么这样做、什么时候用、如何开始。</li>\n<li><strong>适度原则</strong>：过度文档化与零文档同样糟糕，目标是覆盖关键决策与入口，其余交给自解释的代码。</li>\n<li><strong>分层体系</strong>：注释、TSDoc/JSDoc、README、ADR、CHANGELOG 各自服务不同读者与场景。</li>\n<li><strong>注释回答 Why</strong>：注释解释&quot;为什么&quot;，而非复述代码&quot;做了什么&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>ADR 固化决策</strong>：ADR 记录架构决策的背景、决策与后果，把不可逆选择的推理保留下来。</li>\n<li><strong>保鲜机制</strong>：文档需随代码演进，在 PR 流程中嵌入文档更新检查点。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本文后续的分层体系、注释实践、TSDoc/README/ADR/CHANGELOG 规范与维护策略，都是这些概念的具体展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"文档的定位与哲学\">文档的定位与哲学</h2><p>代码是写给机器和人的，但文档纯粹是写给人的。文档的存在价值在于弥合<strong>代码做了什么</strong>和<strong>为什么这样做</strong>之间的鸿沟。优秀的文档体系遵循一个原则：代码说明 How，文档说明 Why 和 When。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[知识载体] --&gt; B[代码]&#10;    A --&gt; C[文档]&#10;    B --&gt; D[&quot;做了什么 (What)&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; E[&quot;怎么做的 (How)&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; F[&quot;为什么这样做 (Why)&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; G[&quot;什么时候用 (When)&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; H[&quot;如何开始 (Getting Started)&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[知识载体] --&gt; B[代码]\n    A --&gt; C[文档]\n    B --&gt; D[\"做了什么 (What)\"]\n    B --&gt; E[\"怎么做的 (How)\"]\n    C --&gt; F[\"为什么这样做 (Why)\"]\n    C --&gt; G[\"什么时候用 (When)\"]\n    C --&gt; H[\"如何开始 (Getting Started)\"]</pre><p>文档不是越多越好。过度文档化的代码库和零文档的代码库一样糟糕——前者让人淹没在过时信息中，后者让人在黑暗中摸索。目标是<strong>恰到好处的文档</strong>：覆盖最关键的决策和入口，让其他内容通过清晰的代码自解释。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"文档分层体系\">文档分层体系</h2><p>不同类型的文档服务于不同的读者和场景：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>文档类型</th>\n<th>主要读者</th>\n<th>更新频率</th>\n<th>存放位置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>内联注释</td>\n<td>修改此代码的开发者</td>\n<td>随代码变更</td>\n<td>源文件中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>API 文档 (TSDoc)</td>\n<td>调用方开发者</td>\n<td>随接口变更</td>\n<td>源文件中，自动生成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>README</td>\n<td>新用户/新成员</td>\n<td>每次大版本</td>\n<td>仓库根目录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>架构决策记录 (ADR)</td>\n<td>团队当前与未来成员</td>\n<td>仅新增不修改</td>\n<td><code>docs/adr/</code> 目录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运维手册 (Runbook)</td>\n<td>值班工程师</td>\n<td>每次故障后</td>\n<td>Wiki 或 <code>docs/runbook/</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变更日志 (CHANGELOG)</td>\n<td>用户和维护者</td>\n<td>每次发版</td>\n<td>仓库根目录</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 代码层&#10;    A[内联注释] --&gt; B[TSDoc]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 项目层&#10;    C[README] --&gt; D[CHANGELOG]&#10;    D --&gt; E[CONTRIBUTING]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 架构层&#10;    F[ADR] --&gt; G[架构图]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 运维层&#10;    H[Runbook] --&gt; I[故障处理手册]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 代码层\n    A[内联注释] --&gt; B[TSDoc]\n    end\n    subgraph 项目层\n    C[README] --&gt; D[CHANGELOG]\n    D --&gt; E[CONTRIBUTING]\n    end\n    subgraph 架构层\n    F[ADR] --&gt; G[架构图]\n    end\n    subgraph 运维层\n    H[Runbook] --&gt; I[故障处理手册]\n    end</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"内联注释的最佳实践\">内联注释的最佳实践</h2><h3 id=\"什么时候写注释\">什么时候写注释</h3><p>注释应该解释<strong>为什么</strong>，而不是<strong>做什么</strong>。如果你发现自己在写&quot;做什么&quot;的注释，说明代码本身不够清晰，应该先改进代码。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const RETRY_DELAY_MS = 1000;&#10;const MAX_RETRIES = 3;&#10;const BACKOFF_MULTIPLIER = 2;&#10;&#10;async function fetchWithRetry(url: string): Promise&lt;Response&gt; {&#10;  let delay = RETRY_DELAY_MS;&#10;&#10;  for (let attempt = 0; attempt &lt;= MAX_RETRIES; attempt++) {&#10;    try {&#10;      return await fetch(url);&#10;    } catch (error) {&#10;      if (attempt === MAX_RETRIES) throw error;&#10;      await sleep(delay);&#10;      delay *= BACKOFF_MULTIPLIER;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  throw new Error(&#39;unreachable&#39;);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> RETRY_DELAY_MS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> MAX_RETRIES</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> BACKOFF_MULTIPLIER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetchWithRetry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">url</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Response</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> delay </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> RETRY_DELAY_MS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> attempt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; attempt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> MAX_RETRIES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; attempt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(url);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (error) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (attempt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> MAX_RETRIES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">throw</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> error;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sleep</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(delay);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      delay </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> BACKOFF_MULTIPLIER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  throw</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'unreachable'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>上面的代码几乎不需要注释，因为常量命名和函数结构已经足够清晰。但下面的场景需要注释：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"async function processPayment(payment: Payment): Promise&lt;PaymentResult&gt; {&#10;  // Stripe API 在高并发时偶发 rate limit，根据 2024-03 事后复盘&#10;  // 决定在支付流程中添加退避重试，详见 ADR-042&#10;  const result = await fetchWithRetry(stripeEndpoint, {&#10;    maxRetries: 5,&#10;    initialDelay: 2000,&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  return mapStripeResponse(result);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> processPayment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">payment</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Payment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">PaymentResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // Stripe API 在高并发时偶发 rate limit，根据 2024-03 事后复盘</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 决定在支付流程中添加退避重试，详见 ADR-042</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetchWithRetry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(stripeEndpoint, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    maxRetries: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    initialDelay: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> mapStripeResponse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(result);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"注释决策矩阵\">注释决策矩阵</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>是否写注释</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>复杂算法的数学原理</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>代码无法表达数学推导</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>绕过框架 Bug 的 Workaround</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>需要说明为什么不走常规路径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第三方 API 的特殊行为</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>调用方无法从代码推断</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变量含义</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>应通过命名自解释</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>函数执行步骤</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>应通过函数拆分自解释</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>已废弃的代码</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>直接删除，依赖版本控制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tsdoc-jsdoc-规范\">TSDoc / JSDoc 规范</h2><p>TSDoc 是 TypeScript 项目的 API 文档标准。它的核心价值在于让文档<strong>与代码共存</strong>，编辑器和文档生成工具都能利用这些信息。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"/**&#10; * 根据用户的会员等级和订单金额计算折扣率。&#10; *&#10; * @remarks&#10; * 折扣规则遵循 2024 年 Q2 定价策略文档。白金会员的折扣率&#10; * 上限为 25%，超出部分以积分形式返还。&#10; *&#10; * @param tier - 用户会员等级&#10; * @param orderTotal - 订单总金额（单位：分）&#10; * @returns 折扣率，范围 [0, 0.25]&#10; *&#10; * @throws {@link InvalidTierError}&#10; * 当传入未知的会员等级时抛出&#10; *&#10; * @example&#10; * ```typescript&#10; * const rate = calculateDiscountRate(&#39;gold&#39;, 50000);&#10; * // rate === 0.15&#10; * ```&#10; */&#10;function calculateDiscountRate(tier: MemberTier, orderTotal: number): number {&#10;  const baseRates: Record&lt;MemberTier, number&gt; = {&#10;    bronze: 0.05,&#10;    silver: 0.1,&#10;    gold: 0.15,&#10;    platinum: 0.2,&#10;  };&#10;&#10;  const rate = baseRates[tier];&#10;  if (rate === undefined) throw new InvalidTierError(tier);&#10;&#10;  const bonusRate = orderTotal &gt; 100000 ? 0.05 : 0;&#10;  return Math.min(rate + bonusRate, 0.25);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/**</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> * 根据用户的会员等级和订单金额计算折扣率。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> *</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> * </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@remarks</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> * 折扣规则遵循 2024 年 Q2 定价策略文档。白金会员的折扣率</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> * 上限为 25%，超出部分以积分形式返还。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> *</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> * </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@param</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tier</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> - 用户会员等级</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> * </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@param</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orderTotal</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> - 订单总金额（单位：分）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> * </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@returns</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> 折扣率，范围 [0, 0.25]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> *</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> * </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@throws</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> {@link InvalidTierError}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> * 当传入未知的会员等级时抛出</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> *</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> * </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@example</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> * ```typescript</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> * const rate = calculateDiscountRate('gold', 50000);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> * // rate === 0.15</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> * ```</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> calculateDiscountRate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">tier</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MemberTier</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">orderTotal</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shi